r lavest prioritet [1]\n\nSom beskrevet i kilden vil konfigurasjonsprioriteten være slik at `source` \"vil ha forrang over `optionsId`, som vil ha forrang over `options`\" hvis flere egenskaper er oppgitt samtidig [1]. Dette betyr at dataen fra datamodellen (`source`) alltid slår kodelister hentet fra filer eller delte ressurser (`optionsId`), og disse igjen slår manuelt definerte alternativer i komponenten selv (`options`).", :terminal-clarification? false, :finish-reason "tool_calls", :golden-in-display? true, :question-id "ue-studio-06-options-kilder-kodeliste", :empty? false, :llm-calls 4, :citation-recall 1.0, :completion-tokens 574, :insufficiency-fired? false, :recall-at-10 1.0, :config-id "snippet-AB", :clarification-rounds 0, :question-tags "altinn-studio,hard", :cached-tokens 0, :golden-features "dfe85e115aa05 R17.7 P1.4 h1.0 or0.7 L2214 0/? ty:content b[0.0,0.0,0.0,0.4,0.0,0.0] | Sources", :response-chars 800, :source "new", :search-passes 2, :n-retrieved 2, :reasoning-tokens 0, :golden-in-search-pool? true, :golden-pool-rank 10, :golden-read? true, :grounding-mode :chunks+answer, :answer-substring-hit? true, :retrieved-chunk-ids "ad0da73c1f75;fc90296b72ff", :enrichment-hits 45, :n-expected 1, :status "complete", :recall-at-20 1.0, :refinement-corpus-grounded? false, :n-cited 1, :prompt-tokens 16650, :pool-head "dc6503e00237e R20.0 P2.5 h2.0 or0.7 L20271 5/? ty:content+phrase b[0.0,0.0,0.0,0.4,0.0,0.0] | Radiobuttons ;; d3dc4df82c6f8 R19.8 P3.7 h3.0 or0.9 L1273 1/? ty:content+metadata+phrase b[0.0,0.0,0.0,0.5,0.1,0.0] | Altinn2 ;; d79b24448fc78 R18.8 P2.5 h2.0 or0.2 L1572 0/? ty:content+phrase b[0.0,0.0,0.0,0.4,0.0,0.0] | Organisation library ;; d604bc397a26f R18.0 P2.6 h2.0 or0.5 L29151 4/? ty:content+phrase b[0.0,0.0,0.0,0.4,0.0,0.0] | Checkboxes ;; d9fa9a32e5988 R18.0 P1.5 h1.0 or0.5 L29081 5/? ty:content b[0.0,0.0,0.0,0.4,0.0,0.0] | Dropdown ;; dd51c0d74ace9 R17.8 P1.4 h1.0 or0.3 L2630 3/? ty:content b[0.0,0.0,0.0,0.4,0.0,0.0] | Accordion ;; d11a68a79