nedlasting av alle vedlegg\n- Direkte journalføring og arkivering i eget sak-/arkivsystem\n- Redusert risiko for manuelle feil og operasjoner[1]\n\nFor å iverksette dette må leverandører av sluttbrukersystemer først følge den definerte onboarding-prosessen[2]. Deretter må dere søke nødvendige autentiseringsscopes via e-post til `servicedesk@altinn.no`, da kun autoriserte klienter har tillatelse til å sende og motta filer gjennom meldings-API-et[3]", :terminal-clarification? false, :finish-reason "tool_calls", :golden-in-display? true, :question-id "ue-corr-03-system-til-system-nedlasting", :empty? false, :llm-calls 3, :citation-recall 1.0, :completion-tokens 413, :insufficiency-fired? false, :recall-at-10 1.0, :config-id "control", :clarification-rounds 0, :question-tags "altinn-correspondence,hard", :cached-tokens 0, :golden-features "dd8ceec8ede98 R15.5 P3.5 h3.0 or0.7 L2876 1/? ty:content+hypothetical-questions+phrase b[0.0,0.0,0.0,0.4,0.0,0.0] +q | Systemprovider", :response-chars 999, :source "new", :search-passes 1, :n-retrieved 1, :reasoning-tokens 0, :golden-in-search-pool? true, :golden-pool-rank 10, :golden-read? true, :grounding-mode :chunks+answer, :answer-substring-hit? true, :retrieved-chunk-ids "939545886fa9", :enrichment-hits 63, :n-expected 1, :status "complete", :recall-at-20 1.0, :refinement-corpus-grounded? nil, :n-cited 1, :prompt-tokens 8185, :pool-head "db542d12475a9 R19.7 P2.4 h2.0 or1.0 L2138 2/? ty:content+hypothetical-questions b[0.0,0.0,0.0,0.4,0.0,0.0] +q | What do you get ;; d3516977ddea0 R18.5 P3.5 h3.0 or0.7 L1294 2/? ty:content+hypothetical-questions+phrase b[0.0,0.0,0.0,0.4,0.0,0.0] +q | Data migration ;; df1f2522e8f93 R17.8 P2.5 h2.0 or0.7 L631 1/? ty:content+phrase b[0.0,0.0,0.0,0.4,0.0,0.0] | Status migration ;; d3516977ddea0 R17.6 P3.6 h3.0 or1.3 L1707 0/? ty:content+hypothetical-questions+phrase b[0.0,0.0,0.0,0.4,0.0,0.0] +q | Data migration ;; db5bf7b3760d7 R16.5 P2.6 h2.0 or1.4 L738 0/? ty:content+phrase b[0.0,0.0,0.0,0.4,0.0