 types (datamodel schemas) and content types for attachment types that are unique to your Altinn 3 application[2].", :terminal-clarification? false, :finish-reason "tool_calls", :golden-in-display? true, :question-id "ue-api-06-app-openapi-swagger-spec", :empty? false, :llm-calls 3, :citation-recall 1.0, :completion-tokens 472, :insufficiency-fired? false, :recall-at-10 1.0, :config-id "control", :clarification-rounds 0, :question-tags "altinn-3-general,hard", :cached-tokens 0, :golden-features "de2aa5b3e74ef R21.0 P1.5 h1.0 or0.7 L1107 0/? ty:content b[0.0,0.0,0.0,0.4,0.0,0.0] | Spec", :response-chars 369, :source "new", :search-passes 1, :n-retrieved 2, :reasoning-tokens 0, :golden-in-search-pool? true, :golden-pool-rank 2, :golden-read? true, :grounding-mode :chunks+answer, :answer-substring-hit? true, :retrieved-chunk-ids "5a9a7c6c6372;42186e0a3d24", :enrichment-hits 61, :n-expected 1, :status "complete", :recall-at-20 1.0, :refinement-corpus-grounded? nil, :n-cited 2, :prompt-tokens 7822, :pool-head "d9cffabf28133 R21.5 P2.7 h2.0 or1.5 L1153 0/? ty:content+phrase b[0.0,0.0,0.0,0.4,0.0,0.0] | Spec", :repeat 0, :error nil, :cited-chunk-ids "5a9a7c6c6372;42186e0a3d24", :expected-chunk-ids "42186e0a3d24", :elapsed-ms 347972, :issued-queries "openapi spec altinn 3 datamodel schemas endpoint | where find openapi-spec app-specific datamodels | app development download datatypes metadata json", :timestamp "2026-06-10T23:49:24.059603Z", :total-tokens 8294, :run-id "f6ce06c2-5b11-417a-a941-c3d6d172bc2f", :golden-display-rank 2, :steps-executed 3, :dataset "public-docs", :length-finish? false, :recall-at-5 1.0} {:response "Based on the provided context, you can find the app-specific OpenAPI specification by visiting `{org}.apps.altinn.no/{org}/{app}/swagger` in a web browser [1].", :terminal-clarification? false, :finish-reason "tool_calls", :golden-in-display? true, :question-id "ue-api-06-app-openapi-swagger-spec", :empty? false, :llm-calls 2, :citation-recall 0.0, :completion-tokens 344, :insufficiency-fired? false, :recall-at-10 1.0, :config-id "control", :clarification-rounds 0, :question-tags "altinn-3-general,hard", :cached-tokens 0, :golden-features "de2aa5b3e74ef R22.1 P1.5 h1.0 or0.8 L1107 0/? ty:content b[0.0,0.0,0.0,0.4,0.0,0.0] | Spec", :response-chars 159, :source "new", :search-passes 1, :n-retrieved 2, :reasoning-tokens 0, :golden-in-search-pool? true, :golden-pool-rank 2, :golden-read? true, :grounding-mode :chunks+answer, :answer-substring-hit? true, :retrieved-chunk-ids "42186e0a3d24;5a9a7c6c6372", :enrichment-hits 55, :n-expected 1, :status "complete", :recall-at-20 1.0, :refinement-corpus-grounded? nil, :n-cited 1, :prompt-tokens 6138, :pool-head "d9cffabf28133 R22.7 P2.7 h2.0 or1.7 L1153 0/? ty:content+phrase b[0.0,0.0,0.0,0.4,0.0,0.0] | Spec", :repeat 1, :error nil, :cited-chunk-ids "5a9a7c6c6372", :expected-chunk-ids "42186e0a3d24", :elapsed-ms 185010, :issued-queries "OpenAPI spec datamodel schemas app specific Altinn 3 | app OpenAPI metadata endpoint modelmetadata schema json/dotnet | datamodels api.json location openapi altinn", :timestamp "2026-06-10T23:49:40.299609Z", :total-tokens 6482, :run-id "d180139d-e363-4cbd-8dc2-96d6008f9d6c", :golden-display-rank 2, :steps-executed 3, :dataset "public-docs", :length-finish? false, :recall-at-5 1.0} {:response "To find the app-specific OpenAPI specification that includes data model schemas for a given Altinn 3 app, you must visit its Swagger endpoint directly in your browser using one of these URL templates:\n\n- `{org}.apps.altinn.no/{org}/{app}/swagger` [1]\n- `https://<org>.apps.<env>.altinn.no/<org>/<app>/swagger` [2]\n\nThe exact placeholder syntax differs slightly between the sources. Source [1] omits an explicit environment variable in the domain path, while source [2] includes `<env>` after `apps.` to account for different deployment tiers (e.g., production or testing) [1][2]. Depending on your specific setup and whether a particular environment must be declared before accessing the app, you will need to substitute `{org}`/`<org>`, `<app>`, and potentially `<env>` with your actual values accordingly.\n\nThis endpoint hosts the **app-specific specification**, which contains schemas for data models and content types that are unique per application [1]. You specifically need this version (available since NuGet package v8.6) rather than the generic app API, because only the app-specific spec includes information about different data types; the alternative Auto-generated/open endpoint exposes all APIs but omits these schema details entirely [1][2].", :terminal-clarification? false, :finish-reason "tool_calls", :golden-in-display? false, :question-id "ue-api-06-app-openapi-swagger-spec", :empty? false, :llm-calls 3, :citation-recall 0.0, :completion-tokens 389, :insufficiency-fired? false, :recall-at-10 0.0, :config-id "snippet-AB", :clarification-rounds 0, :question-tags "altinn-3-general,hard", :cached-tokens 0, :golden-features nil, :response-chars 1257, :source "new", :search-passes 1, :n-retrieved 2, :reasoning-tokens 0, :golden-in-search-pool? false, :golden-pool-rank nil, :golden-read? false, :grounding-mode :chunks+answer, :answer-substring-hit? true, :retrieved-chunk-ids "5a9a7c6c6372;fd1dd9b874ac", :enrichment-hits 59, :n-expected 1, :status "complete", :recall-at-20 0.0, :refinement-corpus-grounded? nil, :n-cited 2, :prompt-tokens 7949, :pool-head "", :repeat 0, :error nil, :cited-chunk-ids "5a9a7c6c6372;fd1dd9b874ac", :expected-chunk-ids "42186e0a3d24", :elapsed-ms 283528, :issued-queries "app-specific openapi spec with datamodel schemas altinn | openapi.json location app development | datamodel schema endpoint openaltinn api", :timestamp "2026-06-10T23:50:24.077861Z", :total-tokens 8338, :run-id "dfb80fd0-9fe3-4716-ba47-5640d46ae3ed", :golden-display-rank nil, :steps-executed 3, :dataset "public-docs", :length-finish? false, :recall-at-5 0.0} {:response "Based on the provided context, you can find the app-specific OpenAPI specification (which includes schemas for data models and content types) by visiting a Swagger endpoint directly in your browser [1]. The exact URL follows one of two formats documented across the sources:\n\n- `{org}.apps.altinn.no/{org}/{app}/swagger` [1]\n- `https://<org>.apps.<env>.altinn.no/<org>/<app>/swagger` [2]\n\nIn both patterns, `<org>` represents your organization name and `<app>` is the specific application identifier. The second format additionally includes an `<env>` placeholder for your deployment environment [2]. \n\nPlease note that these URLs host two distinct OpenAPI specification variants:\n- **Generic app API**: Exposes all endpoints regardless of configuration, but explicitly excludes information about different data types [1], [2].\n- **App-specific API**: Exposes a reduced set of APIs relevant for end-user systems and includes the necessary schemas/data type definitions to generate clients tailored to your application [1], [2].\n\nTo access the spec with datamodel schemas, you will select or view the app-specific variant within that Swagger interface.", :terminal-clarification? false, :finish-reason "tool_calls", :golden-in-display? false, :question-id "ue-api-06-app-openapi-swagger-spec", :empty? false, :llm-calls 3, :citation-recall 0.0, :completion-tokens 389, :insufficiency-fired? false, :recall-at-10 0.0, :config-id "snippet-AB", :clarification-rounds 0, :question-tags "altinn-3-general,hard", :cached-tokens 0, :golden-features nil, :response-chars 1151, :source "new", :search-passes 1, :n-retrieved 2, :reasoning-tokens 0, :golden-in-search-pool? false, :golden-pool-rank nil, :golden-read? false, :grounding-mode :chunks+answer, :answer-substring-hit? true, :retrieved-chunk-ids "5a9a7c6c6372;fd1dd9b874ac", :enrichment-hits 47, :n-expected 1, :status "complete", :recall-at-20 0.0, :refinement-corpus-grounded? nil, :n-cited 2, :prompt-tokens 7931, :pool-head "", :repeat 1, :error nil, :cited-chunk-ids "5a9a7c6c6372;fd1dd9b874ac", :expected-chunk-ids "42186e0a3d24", :elapsed-ms 249710, :issued-queries "where to find app openapi spec altinn | openapi specification datamodels location api v1", :timestamp "2026-06-10T23:53:33.771277Z", :total-tokens 8320, :run-id "3c92c601-05be-463b-81e2-6e021a1463e3", :golden-display-rank nil, :steps-executed 3, :dataset "public-docs", :length-finish? false, :recall-at-5 0.0} {:response "Based on the provided documentation, you can find the app-specific OpenAPI specification by visiting `{org}.apps.altinn.no/{org}/{app}/swagger` in a web browser [2]. This applies to Altinn 3 apps using NuGet packages version 8.6.0 or later, which provide two separate specifications: a general auto-generated one that lacks data type information, and the app-specific specification containing the necessary datamodel schemas and attachment content types [1], [2].", :terminal-clarification? false, :finish-reason "tool_calls", :golden-in-display? true, :question-id "ue-api-06-app-openapi-swagger-spec", :empty? false, :llm-calls 3, :citation-recall 1.0, :completion-tokens 462, :insufficiency-fired? false, :recall-at-10 1.0, :config-id "control", :clarification-rounds 0, :question-tags "altinn-3-general,hard", :cached-tokens 0, :golden-features "de2aa5b3e74ef R20.7 P2.5 h2.0 or0.0 L1107 0/? ty:content+phrase b[0.0,0.0,0.0,0.4,0.0,0.0] | Spec", :response-chars 463, :source "new", :search-passes 1, :n-retrieved 2, :reasoning-tokens 0, :golden-in-search-pool? true, :golden-pool-rank 1, :golden-read? true, :grounding-mode :chunks+answer, :answer-substring-hit? true, :retrieved-chunk-ids "42186e0a3d24;5a9a7c6c6372", :enrichment-hits 52, :n-expected 1, :status "complete", :recall-at-20 1.0, :refinement-corpus-grounded? nil, :n-cited 2, :prompt-tokens 8011, :pool-head "", :repeat 2, :error nil, :cited-chunk-ids "42186e0a3d24;5a9a7c6c6372", :expected-chunk-ids "42186e0a3d24", :elapsed-ms 253610, :issued-queries "hvor finner jeg app-spesifikk openapi spec med datamodel schemas | openapi altinn apiexplorer", :timestamp "2026-06-10T23:53:53.910686Z", :total-tokens 8473, :run-id "b2f55b71-2b16-4f90-a9da-c79e60cc4ce6", :golden-display-rank 1, :steps-executed 3, :dataset "public-docs", :length-finish? false, :recall-at-5 1.0} {:response "You can find the app-specific OpenAPI specification by visiting `https://<org>.apps.<env>.altinn.no/<org>/<app>/swagger` in a web browser [3]. The documentation also references this location as `{org}.apps.altinn.no/{org}/{app}/swagger` [1][2].\n\nAccording to the provided sources, there are two distinct OpenAPI variants available for Altinn 3 apps (available since NuGet package version 8.6.0):\n- **Generic app API** / `traditional auto-generated specification`: Exposes all endpoints across all configurations but intentionally contains no information about different data types or their schemas [1][2][3].\n- **App-specific spec/API**: Provides a reduced, configured set of APIs and includes the specific schema definitions for your application's datamodels. This is required if you need to generate an API client that understands your app's exact data structures [1][2][3].\n\nBe aware that not all endpoints are covered by these specifications; some APIs may be undocumented (typically intended for internal platform use) and could change without notice in the OpenAPI spec [3]. To access datamodel schemas, ensure you are viewing and referencing the **app-specific** variant at the URL above.", :terminal-clarification? false, :finish-reason "tool_calls", :golden-in-display? true, :question-id "ue-api-06-app-openapi-swagger-spec", :empty? false, :llm-calls 3, :citation-recall 1.0, :completion-tokens 479, :insufficiency-fired? false, :recall-at-10 1.0, :config-id "snippet-AB", :clarification-rounds 0, :question-tags "altinn-3-general,hard", :cached-tokens 0, :golden-features "de2aa5b3e74ef R23.4 P2.5 h2.0 or1.1 L1107 0/? ty:content+phrase b[0.0,0.0,0.0,0.4,0.0,0.0] | Spec", :response-chars 1195, :source "new", :search-passes 1, :n-r